{"id":"n17882-2-12","stage":1,"title":"가리키다 · 指向","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17882-2-12-1","ko":"시계가 오후 다섯 시를 가리키니 이제 퇴근합시다.","zh":"手表显示已经是下午五点了，我们现在下班吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시계가","meaning":"钟，表","explanation":"시계：钟，表；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시계","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30190","senseId":"1","lemma":"시계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오후","meaning":"下午，午后","explanation":"오후：下午，午后","readings":[{"term":"오후","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67457","senseId":"1","lemma":"오후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시를","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가리키니","meaning":"指向，指示","explanation":"가리키다：指向，指示；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"가리키다","audio":"/audio/5f794186590f0c1fbeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17882","senseId":"2","lemma":"가리키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"퇴근합시다.","meaning":"下班","explanation":"퇴근하다：下班；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"퇴근하다","audio":"/audio/b94b2beefd0df40e1642.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82103","senseId":"1","lemma":"퇴근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a658dc1b94077c9f","term":"시계","zh":"钟，表","audio":"/audio/a658dc1b94077c9f96de.mp3",